<title>USA: Neiman Marcus 97 Q1 net falls after charge.</title>
<headline>Neiman Marcus 97 Q1 net falls after charge.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.06		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			   2,340		   17,770</p>
<p> Revs			544,103		  489,898</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   39,601		   38,088</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 Q1 includes a non-cash, after-tax charge of $22.4 million equal to $0.56 per share relating to its early redemption of all of its outstanding preferred stocks.</p>
<p>Operating earnings were $59.2 million, while net earnings before a non-recurring charge were $30.9 million. Per share earnings were $0.62, after preferred dividend and before the non-recurring charge, compared to $0.47 in the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>Full company name is Neiman Marcus Group Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
